<h2>Your <%= app_name %> licence key</h2>

<p>Thank you<% if plan_name then %> for buying <strong><%= plan_name %></strong><% end %>. Here is your licence key:</p>

<div class="code-box"><%= licence_key %></div>

<p>Enter it in <%= app_name %> to activate it on this device. Keep it safe: anyone with the key can use your licence.</p>

<% if account_link then %>
<p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
  <a href="<%= account_link %>" class="btn">Manage my licences</a>
</p>
<% end %>
